  "name": "High Bar",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Expectations are high for you, but you are able to meet them for people who want a taste of your unique brand of magic. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.QLeMH5mQgh28sa5o]{Specialty Crafting} feat. If you have the Specialty Crafting feat, you can either select another specialty or you can gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.PiUe3tpv7UVtnfvS]{Impeccable Crafting} feat.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">When you use your visionary skill to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.QyzlsLrqM0EEwd7j]{Earn Income} or to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.rmwa3OyhTZ2i2AHl]{Craft} magical scrolls, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the check. In addition, whenever you roll a critical failure on an Earn Income check that uses your visionary skill, you can roll a second time and take the new result.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span> If you have the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.Pl5YLdiMtUCW1XLB]{Catalyst Artist} or @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.UGARByXDuXQ8Dy0Y]{Body is a Canvas} feat, the circumstance bonus when using your visionary skills to craft these items also apply.</p>"
    },
